      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">MIND LIKE WATER</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\">The target state for human attention</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"190\" width=\"500\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\">CALM POND</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"380\" r=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.6\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"380\" r=\"50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.8\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"380\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#10b981\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Responds, then returns.</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"545\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#888\">\"Appropriate. Proportionate.\"</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"190\" width=\"480\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ef4444\">VIBRATING POND</text><circle cx=\"810\" cy=\"380\" r=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"810\" cy=\"380\" r=\"60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"810\" cy=\"380\" r=\"40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"810\" cy=\"380\" r=\"20\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><circle cx=\"760\" cy=\"350\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><circle cx=\"860\" cy=\"410\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><circle cx=\"780\" cy=\"420\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Still rippling from pebbles</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"545\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#888\">\"Late email. Friday deck. Mom.\"</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"620\" width=\"940\" height=\"270\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#6366f1\">THE GTD PROMISE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"745\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">A mind free to engage fully with what is in front of it.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Every commitment captured and trusted outside your head.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Cost: roughly one disciplined hour per week.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"930\" width=\"900\" height=\"110\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"995\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Mind like water is not Zen poetry — it is a spec.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Two ponds, two mental states. GTD targets the calm one."
