      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">THE BRAIN IS NOT A FILING CABINET</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\">It is brilliant at thinking, terrible at holding</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"190\" width=\"500\" height=\"420\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#6366f1\">BRAIN IS GREAT AT</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Generating ideas</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Spotting patterns</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Associative leaps</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Creative recombination</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Empathy and nuance</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#888\">\"A poet, not a database.\"</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"190\" width=\"480\" height=\"420\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ef4444\">BRAIN IS BAD AT</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Holding structured lists</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Recalling at the right moment</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Tracking dozens of loops</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Filtering by context</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Sleeping through worry</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#888\">\"Milk remembered far from store.\"</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"650\" width=\"940\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"710\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\">ALLEN'S RULE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">The mind is for HAVING ideas,</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">not for HOLDING them.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Move every commitment into an external system.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"920\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"985\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">Use the poet for poetry, the cabinet for filing.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Stop asking your brain to do a job it was never designed to do."
