     "explanation": "Allen's Clarify protocol is exactly two questions in this order. **Q1: What is it?** forces every blob to identify itself before any decision is made. **Q2: Is it actionable?** sorts the named item into the not-actionable branch (trash, incubate, reference) or the actionable branch (next action). Importance, sender, and work/personal classification all come **later**, in Organize and Engage — and only if needed.",
