      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">MODEL 2 — 3-FOLD NATURE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\">Which mode am I in right now?</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#6366f1\">TYPE 1 — PREDEFINED</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Doing items already on your lists</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Calm, deliberate execution</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"375\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Target: ~60% of healthy week.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"420\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f59e0b\">TYPE 2 — AS IT SHOWS UP</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Real-time interruptions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Legitimate when real emergencies</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"615\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Target: ~20% — not 100%.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"660\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"720\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\">TYPE 3 — DEFINING WORK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"775\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Capture, clarify, organize, reflect</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Builds the predefined-work list</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-style=\"italic\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Target: ~20%. Underrated. Easy to skip.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"910\" width=\"900\" height=\"130\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"975\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">THE TRAP</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1025\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Chronic Type 2 + skipped Type 3 = underwater.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "All three are legitimate. The mix matters."
