      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">COMBINING THE THREE MODELS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\">Layered, then reflexive</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#6366f1\">1. WHICH MODE? (3-Fold)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">Predefined, reactive, or defining?</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"320\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\">2. CONTEXT (4-Crit #1)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">Pull only lists relevant to where I am.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"460\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"510\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\">3. TIME (4-Crit #2)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"550\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">Cross off what won't fit.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"600\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f59e0b\">4. ENERGY (4-Crit #3)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"690\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">Match to current cognitive state.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"740\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"790\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ec4899\">5. PRIORITY (4-Crit #4)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"830\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">Among the 2-5 left, pick highest impact.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"880\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"930\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\">6. HORIZONS CHECK (occasional)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"970\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">Does this roll up to something I care about?</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"1010\" width=\"900\" height=\"50\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1045\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\">5-10 sec reflex after a few weeks.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Five filters and a horizon check — eventually a glance."
